two samples in the same millisecond: the later line wins, whatever the values
  ok   a mid logged after a fill in the same ms is the last mid
  ok   of two mid lines with one timestamp the later line is the last mid
  ok   a fill's own mid, logged after a mid line in the same ms, is the last mid
