crossing zero, carried inventory
  ok   long 1 at 100, sell 1.5 at 101: realised 1.00, short 0.5 from 101 marked at 100.50 gives 0.25, total 1.25 (1.0000 / 0.2500 / 1.2500)
  ok   short 1 at 100, buy back 0.5 at 99: realised 0.50, the rest (short 0.5 from 100, mid 99.00) 0.50, total 1.00 (0.5000 / 1.0000)
  ok   the mid only gets logged when it changes: a quiet log still reaches the horizon, the last mid holds
  ok   started with 1.0, valued at the first fill's mid (100.00): total 1.10 (1.1000)
